Z||000001||mrfiero||12-23-2001||06:58 PM||||I give up......how many?<P><BR>It's hard to say, but there were approximately 300 '88 Formulas that came with factory T-Tops (CJB code) and since red was a plentiful color, I would suspect a large percentage were red.  I do know that there were quite a few burgundy ones made......I know a guy who owned 5 of them!<P>Is your Formula a CJB car?  I don't think you will get a definitive answer on this......unfortunately no records were kept on what colors got T-Tops.<P> ||||reg||12
